name: Money Tree — max interest cap
author: corpus
description: >-
  Money Tree raises the interest cap to $20 per round. Tier-2 voucher: requires Seed Money
  bought first, so the earliest practical target is Ante 2. RAG aliases: interest cap,
  rich run, Bootstraps money, Bull money pile.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - voucher: MoneyTree
    antes: [2]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
should:
  - joker: ToTheMoon
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: Bootstraps
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 40
  - joker: GoldenJoker
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
